{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Oh, Kenji... Wahhh...": "",
  "That was a close call, huh?": "",
  "I'll say. I was really at the end of my rope. Heh.": "",
  "(Tomioka-san is looking a little frazzled. What happened?)": "",
  "(What the hell kinda logic is that? Oh well, guess this is going to get tricky...)": "",
  "You know your mother would be heartbroken, right?": "",
  "My mother died a year ago! I can finally see her again!": "",
  "O-Oh, my bad. Sorry to hear that...": "",
  "(She's right. I need to find out more about him first.)": "",
  "You know if you fall from here it'll be really painful, right?": "",
  "It would be nothing compared to the pain in my heart right now!": "",
  "(Okay, what in the world happened to this guy?)": "",
  "All right, this is it... One... Two...": "",
  "My office is right here in this building! If you die here, it'll be really bad for business!": "",
  "If you have to do this, can't you pick a different building?": "",
  "Oh, I'm sorry my death would be an inconvenience! Maybe I should just die, then!": "",
  "No, no, but... Isn't there a better way to do this? Have you considered... drowning, maybe?": "",
  "That's enough, Yagami-kun! Stop that before I kick <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind> off this building!": "",
  "My bad...": "",
  "(Better head up to the roof. I feel like an angel of death right now...)": "",
  "(Great, at this distance, their faces are perfectly clear!)": "",
  "(It's a pretty perfect shot.)": "",
  "(Hm, their faces are a little small... But I'm sure it's good enough for that cop.)": "",
  "She's petite with short hair and glasses.": "",
  "And listen! If she's cheating on me, I want photographic proof! I want to see this man's face, clear as day!": "",
  "...So that after I die, I can haunt him!": "",
  "Be careful, Yagami-san! Tread lightly when it comes to family!": "",
  "Ah, Yagami. I appreciate you coming.": "",
  "No problem. Let's hear about this job.": "",
  "Why don't you take a seat first?": "",
  "So. What can I do for you?": "",
  "I've got another photo surveillance request, actually.  But this one's a little sticky.": "",
  "In other words, it's big. News cycle big.": "",
  "How big are we talking here?": "",
  "Actually, why don't you start at the beginning?": "",
  "Well, I'm chasing a political scandal.": "",
  "Trust me, if we can get a lens on this, those pictures are gonna be on the front page of every paper.": "",
  "All right, I'm intrigued. What kind of scandal are we talking about?": "",
  "Just business as usual in politics. This politician has been having backroom conversations he shouldn't be.": "",
  "The guy's an ex-pro wrestler, so of course he's been working to set up this massive sporting event of some sort.": "",
  "And guess who's winning the bids for the job? The guys paying him up front, that's who.": "",
  "So you're saying he's taking bribes.": "",
  "Yup. And I'm guessing based on that, you know we're talking about Miki, right?": "",
  "Well, how many wrestlers go into politics? Of course I've heard of him.": "",
  "Good. I've been on Miki's trail for quite a while now.": "",
  "He's got this big dinner coming up tonight, and I'd be willing to bet that some money changes hands under the table.": "",
  "That your reporter's intuition talking?": "",
  "Yeah. But the problem is, I'm already made.": "",
  "Miki has all his big meetings at a restaurant called Kikunoya, but I can't get in there anymore.": "",
  "Did he catch you tailing him or something? And what do you mean that you \"can't get in\"?": "",
  "I'm not that stupid. But I do think he's onto me, and he probably has this restaurant by the balls.": "",
  "They'd turn me away at the door if I tried to get in there that night.": "",
  "I think I'm getting the picture. If you can't get in, you need an unknown face to get the shot.": "",
  "Exactly. You've just gotta get into that restaurant and catch the money transfer.": "",
  "I see. Well, at least it's clear now.": "",
  "I'll even make your reservation for you. You'll take the job, right?": "",
  "I will. And as far as payment goes...": "",
  "I'm betting big on this, so I'll make it 150,000 yen. That's enough, I hope?": "",
  "Yeaaah. That's enough.": "",
  "I thought you might like the number. Just don't let me down, okay?": "",
  "All right. I'll let you know when I've got something.": "",
  "Looking forward to it, Yagami-san.": "",
  "(All right. Let's go check out this restaurant.)": "",
  "(Getting the reservation gets me in, but how do I know where this politician's gonna be seated?)": "",
  "Our bottle's empty, dumbass! What's it gonna take to get you idiots to pay attention to my table!?": "",
  "M-My apologies, sir! I'll bring another right away!": "",
  "How am I supposed to focus on steering this country when I've gotta yell at the waitstaff to keep my table stocked!?": "",
  "You've got a rowdy crowd tonight.": "",
  "I apologize for the inconvenience, sir.": "",
  "Sounds like your guy over there has a drinking problem. He a yakuza or something?": "",
  "No, no, sir. Nothing of the sort.": "",
  "That's funny, he was talking about steering the country. Maybe politics, then?": "",
  "I could swear I recognized that voice. Isn't he the pro wrestler who turned politician?": "",
  "A-Ahaha. Well... I suppose it's hard to mistake his voice.": "",
  "Where's the goddamn owner? Do I really gotta pour my own drinks?": "",
  "And is that customer the prime minister or something? Do I have to wait until you're done serving the peasants!?": "",
  "He's a class act, huh?": "",
  "I'm terribly sorry, sir...": "",
  "Nah, don't worry about me. You should probably check on him before he blows a gasket.": "",
  "I do apologize, sir. If you'll excuse me.": "",
  "(I can't complain. The guy being a raging asshole pointed me right to him.)": "",
  "(I should get in position, myself.)": "",
  "Hohashi-san, I couldn't help but notice the gift you seem to have brought with you.": "",
  "Yes, I believe this \"snack\" should meet your expectations, Miki-san...": "",
  "(Wait, did he really put his cash in a confection box? That's the oldest trick in the book...)": "",
  "Yes, I've been looking forward to seeing the extent of your effort...": "",
  "Eh? What's this?": "",
  "Oh, it's a popular treat from my hometown. Very tasty, sir.": "",
  "Oh, I see. So what I'm after is...": "",
  "Not... underneath?": "",
  "(No way... If there's no bribe, a photo is useless...)": "",
  "Hohashi-san. Wasn't I clear when I told you I expected a \"gift\" in exchange for the contract?": "",
  "Yes, of course. That's why I brought you the confection box, sir.": "",
  "Hohashi! Are you that dense!? You have to know that wasn't what I meant, don't you!?": "",
  "I told you I wanted to see just how \"sincere\" you were about this! Can't you take a hint!?": "",
  "Y-You're not a fan, I take it? I didn't know, sir! I'm so sorry!": "",
  "Y-You still don't get it?": "",
  "...Get what, sir?": "",
  "It's execution time!": "",
  "Wah...": "",
  "Aghhhhhhh!": "",
  "(Woah!)": "",
  "You got it through your thick skull, yet!? Huh, Hohashi!?": "",
  "Ahhhh! No! I don't know what you're talking about!": "",
  "(I should probably get a picture of this. It may not be a bribe, but it's a scandal, all right. I need to find a position where I can get a clear shot of Miki's face.)": "",
  "(I can't even tell who's assaulting who from this angle...)": "",
  "(Hmm. Miki isn't looking at the camera, but I guess you can still tell it's him.)": "",
  "Look at all this dirt! I better clean this up...": "",
  "Shhhhhit.": "",
  "H-Hey! What are you doing, sir!?": "",
  "Who's there!?": "",
  "Damn, cover's blown. Better make a break for it!": "",
  "Security! Don't let this man escape!": "",
  "(Shit. I guess there's no avoiding this...)": "",
  "You a reporter from one of those magazines? I've had enough of you flies buzzing around me!": "",
  "...Tch. If you're attracting flies, it's probably because you're rotten.": "",
  "Gahaha! That's cute. But did you forget I used to be a pro wrestler? Might wanna watch your mouth.": "",
  "Oh, I didn't forget. I guess I'm just not cheesy enough to play along with your shitty wrestler act.": "",
  "You little punk. The next time you wake up, you'll be in a hospital bed!": "",
  "Get him, boys!": "",
  "What... How did this happen...?": "",
  "Anyone else you wanna tag in, or are you done siccing your goons at me?": "",
  "I admit... You're pretty good. You know, I could use a guy like you on my staff. What do you say?": "",
  "What, and end up unemployed when this scandal sends you straight to jail?": "",
  "L-Listen, just get rid of that photo! I can pay!": "",
  "Not a chance. If you're rotten enough to attract flies, I'm sure your money smells like shit too.": "",
  "When this photo goes public, I suggest you clean up your life. Maybe the flies'll move onto the next shit stain.": "",
  "Urghhh...": "",
  "Good work, Yagami-san! Looks like I'm gonna be able to write quite a piece on this guy.": "",
  "I didn't get any shots of the bribe you wanted, but I guess it still turned out?": "",
  "Oh, for sure! This beats a bribe any day!": "",
  "I'm actually pretty impressed you were able to improvise like that. Maybe you've got a future as a news photographer?": "",
  "Haha, I wonder.": "",
  "Well, you ever feel like a career change, just drop me a line.": "",
  "If the detective thing doesn't pan out, maybe I'll take you up on that.": "",
  "I'm sorry, she's with another customer at the moment, sir...": "",
  "(I better get it from an angle that proves Miki is the aggressor, before the president gets destroyed...)": "",
  "(I need to get a photo of the money changing hands so it's clear evidence of a bribe. Just need the right timing.)": "",
  "(All right! No doubt that's Miki in this shot.)": "",
  "(Councillor assaults business partner at high-end restaurant... The headline writes itself.)": "",
  "Fuckin' dieeeeeeeeeeeee!": "",
  "Ahhhhhhhhhhhh!": "",
  "(S-Shit! It was too late!)": "",
  "(This position won't work... Is there a different angle I could take a photo from?)": "",
  "(Maybe I could take a photo from between that gap...?)": "",
  "Hey, man! I'm Tatsuo, and I own the bar just over there. You look thirsty, my friend.": "",
  "Do I?": "",
  "Only 2,000 yen for a drink, what do you say?": "",
  "(Oh, he's a barker.)": "",
  "H-Hey, come on, man! I'm in serious trouble right now!": "",
  "A big party just cancelled on me and I'm so screwed if I don't fill some tables!": "",
  "So, please! Can't you hear me out?": "",
  "Like I said, I run that bar over there with my wife. It's got a real nice vibe, and pretty good food, if I do say so myself.": "",
  "But losing customers like this has put us in a real pinch. If you have a drink, you'll really be helping us out!": "",
  "(Damn, this guy's not giving up, is he?)": "",
  "Just 2,000 yen, right?": "",
  "Totally! It's a panic sale! You won't regret it!": "",
  "Sorry, but I've got places to be.": "",
  "Oh come on, don't be like that!": "",
  "Aw, wait!": "",
  "Fine. Just one drink.": "",
  "Now we're talking! Please, right this way.": "",
  "(If anything about this turns sketchy, I'm walking right out the door.)": "",
  "Oh, what's this? A customer?": "",
  "You're darn right, Maki. Caught this guy wandering right outside, and offered him a drink.": "",
  "Honey, don't tell me...": "",
  "Were you out there harassing people again!? Didn't I tell you it's against the law!? ": "",
  "Sh-Shut up, woman! It's my bar, and I'll do what I want!": "",
  "Oh it's your bar, is it? What if I stop helping you with it, then!?": "",
  "Oh really!? You're the one who needs the cash to fund your host club addiction!": "",
  "I haven't gone to a host club in forever! And I've worked more than enough to make up for it!": "",
  "(How did I manage to walk into a marital spat...)": "",
  "You're ridiculous! I'm going to go have a drink!": "",
  "O-Oh, I'm sorry, sir!": "",
  "That must have been terribly awkward for you. I don't want to keep you...": "",
  "No, it's fine. I don't mind ordering the drink I said I would.": "",
  "What would you like, sir?": "",
  "You have any recommendations?": "",
  "We actually just restocked some top shelf whisky today. We can barely keep this stuff in the house.": "",
  "Seems like it's a good bargain for a great taste, if you ask me.": "",
  "Sounds right up my alley.": "",
  "Okay. Coming right up.": "",
  "Thanks for the drink. It was nice.": "",
  "I'm glad you enjoyed yourself. Come back any time.": "",
  "Oh yeah, I'm sorry, but we don't take cards. Can I ask you to pay in cash?": "",
  "Sure, I've got 2,000 yen on me.": "",
  "W-Wait, why is this bill for 100,000 yen!?": "",
  "You sure that's right?": "",
  "Really? Did I put the wrong price?": "",
  "Oh, I'm afraid not, sir. Everything looks correct to me.": "",
  "100,000 yen. In cash please.": "",
  "(Th-They got me... These conniving...)": "",
  "(They ripped me off!)": "",
  "Oh, sir, are you unable to pay?": "",
  "Back it up a sec! Any way you slice it, 100,000 for a shot of whisky is ridiculous!": "",
  "Your husband said the prices were reasonable!": "",
  "They are reasonable, sir. But I've included the service fee for my world-class bartending.": "",
  "Are you listening to me? Your husband said it was a 2,000 yen drink!": "",
  "Oh, my husband has no idea what we charge. I keep telling him to stop quoting prices.": "",
  "That stupid man... Look at him, causing such misunderstandings.": "",
  "You're shameless. That fight earlier was just to lower my guard, wasn't it?": "",
  "I don't know what you're talking about.": "",
  "Now, if you would, the check, sir.": "",
  "The police are going to catch on to this, you know.": "",
  "Please. The police don't have time to deal with civil affairs in this town. They wouldn't come if you reported me.": "",
  "(She knows the game too well... Damn it.)": "",
  "Sir, I have plans after this, so if you don't mind, can you please close your tab?": "",
  "You think I'm just going to cough up that kind of money?": "",
  "Eh!?": "",
  "If you don't pay, I'll stab myself. And who do you think they'll blame?": "",
  "Are you really ready to pay the price for stabbing a poor, defenseless woman?": "",
  "Y-You wouldn't...": "",
  "Oh, but I would. I'll scream, and then stab myself, right here.": "",
  "I'm not paying!": "",
  "Fine. You asked for it.": "",
  "W-Wait just a minute!": "",
  "(Gah, shit. What do I do now?)": "",
  "F-Fine, I'll pay! Just lower the knife!": "",
  "100,000. Not a yen less.": "",
  "(I've got to buy some time...)": "",
  "(Is there no other way? Nothing I can see?)": "",
  "(Hm, there's a tan line on her finger. Does that mean her wedding ring is usually on?)": "",
  "(If so, that would mean she's taken it off specifically for tonight...)": "",
  "(Maybe this woman really is about to go have an affair?)": "",
  "Hey! How long are you going to stare into space? Pay up already!": "",
  "(It pisses me off to no end, but I think I should just pay her... For now.)": "",
  "(Crap. It's that same barker.)": "",
  "Yo! You feelin' like a drink, my man?": "",
  "Only 2,000 yen! It's a big ol' sale!": "",
  "(She's sure wearing a lot of makeup tonight. And it's immaculate. She couldn't do this every day, could she?)": "",
  "I see you sizing me up, pretty boy. I'm quite a catch, huh? You caught me on a good night.": "",
  "(So she did go the extra mile tonight...)": "",
  "If you keep staring, I'm going to add it to your tab.": "",
  "What, you think I'll give you even more?": "",
  "Even beauty has its price, sweetie!": "",
  "In fact, now that I look at you... You're handsome, in a rugged sort of way. Would you like to pay... physically?": "",
  "No, no! I'll give you your money!": "",
  "(This woman is something else...)": "",
  "(She's pretty dressed up tonight.)": "",
  "Hmhm, are you eyeing my necklace? I like to wear this one on special occasions.": "",
  "Special occasions?": "",
  "Oh, don't worry, it's got nothing to do with you.": "",
  "But if you want to fantasize about my body and my necklace later tonight, you're welcome to it!": "",
  "(A special occasion tonight, huh? That must mean she's meeting someone...)": "",
  "(Is she meeting her husband? Or someone else? Maybe this'll be my lucky break.)": "",
  "(It could be completely harmless, but if it's not... I'll have my bargaining chip. I'm desperate here.)": "",
  "So the service fee is 40,000 yen, and then there's a pouring fee of 50,000!?": "",
  "When we sell everything at 2,000 yen a drink, we have to make the money somehow. Why complain?": "",
  "Because it's robbery, that's why!": "",
  "Why come to a bar if all you're going to do is complain!?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "My bad...": "ขอโทษครับ...",
  "Who's there!?": "ใครอยู่ตรงนั้น!?",
  "Urghhh...": "อึ๋กก...",
  "Ahhhhhhhhhhhh!": "อาาาาาาาาา!",
  "Do I?": "งั้นเหรอวะ?",
  "I don't know what you're talking about.": "ผมไม่รู้ว่าคุณกำลังพูดถึงอะไร",
  "Eh!?": "หา!?"
 }
}
